ipts/2018/08/23/l-brands-inc-lb-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2018 Q2","e":"lb","d":"2018-08-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stuart Burgdoerfer","x":"But a business like Victoria's Secret, stores and digital, high quality brand, pricing power, nature of competition, etc., we believe that that business when running optimally should be a high teens operating income rate business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/23/l-brands-inc-lb-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2018 Q4","e":"lb","d":"2019-02-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stuart Burgdoerfer","x":"After reducing guidance in the middle of 2018, we beat those reduced forecast in both the third and fourth quarters on an adjusted basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/28/l-brands-inc-lb-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2019 Q1","e":"lb","d":"2019-05-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stuart Burgdoerfer","x":"Again, even despite the call-outs that we had in the prepared remarks and including the pressure from the List 3 tariff move from 10% to 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/23/l-brands-inc-lb-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2019 Q1","e":"lb","d":"2019-05-23","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Altschwager","x":"…throughout the year, but as we lap some of those other benefits, and then it sounds like maybe we're baking in some incremental tariff headwinds, just how should we think about the EBIT margin rate progression through the year for Victoria's Secret relative to that 300 basis point decline in Q1?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/23/l-brands-inc-lb-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2019 Q1","e":"lb","d":"2019-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stuart Burgdoerfer","x":"We closed more stores or announced plans to close more stores, have closed more stores to right-size square footage in 2019 than we had historically as an example of taking a hard fresh look at things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/23/l-brands-inc-lb-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2019 Q2","e":"lb","d":"2019-08-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stuart Burgdoerfer","x":"The significant amount of change in our Fall merchandise assortments and promotional plans as well as the current trade environment and tariff uncertainty, inherently result in a greater level of uncertainty in forecasting our results for the third and fourth quarters than is typical.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/22/lbrands-inc-lb-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2019 Q2","e":"lb","d":"2019-08-22","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"William Reuter","x":"I was wondering, if you could talk of a little bit about the list for tariffs at 10%, I think most of your products were included on list 4A, but what the impact of this would be either on a dollar basis for 2019, or how we should think about it on an annual basis going forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/22/lbrands-inc-lb-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2019 Q2","e":"lb","d":"2019-08-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stuart Burgdoerfer","x":"And you've got to be thoughtful about not getting into an ongoing cost cutting exercise that can hurt the near-term and longer-term prospects for the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/22/lbrands-inc-lb-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2019 Q3","e":"lb","d":"2019-11-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stuart Burgdoerfer","x":"There is some impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/21/lbrands-inc-lb-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LB 2019 Q3","e":"lb","d":"2019-11-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stuart Burgdoerfer","x":"But